{"4177310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Caves of Madness", "steam_appid": 4177310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177310/extras/cb81d3d7de833e96a3360e4623546078.avif?t=1784676723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177310/extras_big/cb81d3d7de833e96a3360e4623546078.webp?t=1784676723 width=1560 height=292 /></span>You’ve entered a mysterious cave — the source of powerful crystals used to heal the sick, fuel deadly weapons, and even grant magical abilities. But beware: ancient evils lurk in the shadows, hungry for your soul. Will you risk your sanity and your life to claim the power within, or will the darkness consume you before you reach your goal?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Roguelike Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends — or meet new allies in-game — in this 3-player cooperative roguelike experience. Every run is different, and survival depends on teamwork, strategy, and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                              </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Champion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from three unique starting classes, each with their own playstyle and powers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Seraphin: A mighty warrior who channels lunar energy to strike enemies and shield allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Baron: A shadowy alchemist who supports the team with potions, traps, and arcane tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Dwarf: A fearless frontline fighter who provides rations and morale to keep the party thriving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close and communicate as you explore the cave’s treacherous depths. But be warned — wandering off alone might be the last mistake you ever make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and food are your lifelines. Every decision costs precious resources, and the deeper you go, the greater the risk. Explore a dynamic world where survival depends on careful planning and bold choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177310/extras/0b87c9bb7da14d1d07d6cf3cfdadda71.avif?t=1784676723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177310/extras_big/0b87c9bb7da14d1d07d6cf3cfdadda71.webp?t=1784676723 width=1560 height=292 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177310/extras/cb81d3d7de833e96a3360e4623546078.avif?t=1784676723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177310/extras_big/cb81d3d7de833e96a3360e4623546078.webp?t=1784676723 width=1560 height=292 /></span>You’ve entered a mysterious cave — the source of powerful crystals used to heal the sick, fuel deadly weapons, and even grant magical abilities. But beware: ancient evils lurk in the shadows, hungry for your soul. Will you risk your sanity and your life to claim the power within, or will the darkness consume you before you reach your goal?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Roguelike Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends — or meet new allies in-game — in this 3-player cooperative roguelike experience. Every run is different, and survival depends on teamwork, strategy, and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                              </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Champion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from three unique starting classes, each with their own playstyle and powers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Seraphin: A mighty warrior who channels lunar energy to strike enemies and shield allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Baron: A shadowy alchemist who supports the team with potions, traps, and arcane tricks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Dwarf: A fearless frontline fighter who provides rations and morale to keep the party thriving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close and communicate as you explore the cave’s treacherous depths. But be warned — wandering off alone might be the last mistake you ever make.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light and food are your lifelines. Every decision costs precious resources, and the deeper you go, the greater the risk. Explore a dynamic world where survival depends on careful planning and bold choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177310/extras/0b87c9bb7da14d1d07d6cf3cfdadda71.avif?t=1784676723\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177310/extras_big/0b87c9bb7da14d1d07d6cf3cfdadda71.webp?t=1784676723 width=1560 height=292 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Co-op action-adventure fantasy game where you and your friends explore vast mysterious caves, collect powerful crystals, battle terrifying ancient evils, and unlock magical abilities while communicating t